# What Alone in the Dark's installer copies, as its !Installer.Actions says: the game from disc 1,
# with !RunGame as its !Run, an empty Save folder, and the Data folder of every disc. Two files are
# split across discs and joined: ListSamp from discs 2 and 4, and Camera05 from discs 3 and 4.
copy 1 $.!Alone.!Boot $.!Alone.!Boot
copy 1 $.!Alone.!RunGame $.!Alone.!Run
copy 1 $.!Alone.!Sprites $.!Alone.!Sprites
copy 1 $.!Alone.!RunImage $.!Alone.!RunImage
copy 1 $.!Alone.!Run_AITD $.!Alone.!Run_AITD
copy 1 $.!Alone.VoxLib $.!Alone.VoxLib
copy 1 $.!Alone.Data $.!Alone.Data
folder $.!Alone.Save
copy 2 $.Data.Lists_1 $.!Alone.Data.ListSamp
copy 2 $.Data.Priority $.!Alone.Data.Priority
copy 2 $.Data.Vars/ITD $.!Alone.Data.Vars/ITD
copy 3 $.Data.cam5_1 $.!Alone.Data.Camera05
copy 3 $.Data.Defines $.!Alone.Data.Defines
copy 3 $.Data.Etage00 $.!Alone.Data.Etage00
join 4 $.Data.Lists_2 $.!Alone.Data.ListSamp
join 4 $.Data.cam5_2 $.!Alone.Data.Camera05
copy 4 $.Data.Camera03 $.!Alone.Data.Camera03
copy 5 $.Data $.!Alone.Data
copy 6 $.Data $.!Alone.Data
copy 7 $.Data $.!Alone.Data
copy 8 $.Data $.!Alone.Data
